OL,3,ATwo senior Reform UK officials step
OL,4,Adown after undercover donations report
OL,5,
OL,6,FTwo senior officials step down from
OL,7,FReform UK after a Channel 4 News report
OL,8,Fprompts the party to investigate claims
OL,9,Fabout funding
OL,11,FUndercover filming, by Verbatim
OL,12,FInvestigations, shows Nigel Farage's
OL,13,Fsenior aide Dan Jukes suggesting a way
OL,14,Fto get around electoral law to secure a
OL,15,F#500,000 foreign donation for Reform -
OL,16,Fwatch a clip
OL,18,FJukes and James Orr, the party's head
OL,19,Fof policy, have stepped down while the
OL,20,Finternal investigation takes place
OL,23,APub: 04-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG3/39
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
