OL,3,A'Layer upon layer of miracles': How
OL,4,ANepal flood survivors were rescued from
OL,5,Atunnel
OL,6,
OL,7,F"It's like layer upon layer of
OL,8,Fmiracles" that they found two men on
OL,9,FFriday, he said, given the multiple
OL,10,Fchallenges that they faced.
OL,12,FThe first hurdle was to locate the
OL,13,Fentrance to the tunnel, in a landscape
OL,14,Frendered nearly unrecognisable by the
OL,15,Fflood that has so far killed 1,300
OL,16,Fpeople.
OL,23,APub: 04-SepQpppppppppppppppppppppG10/39
